height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out7" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/state (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;state/2 — 상태 · 알림(공급 · no_match_block · tilted_block · 웹 끊김 · 정지 · 완성)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="2982.0" width="210.0" height="71.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out8" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/progress (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;progress/2.0 → 장면 관리 · 다리 → 화면&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3063.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out9" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/task/scan_result (토픽)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;scan_result/2.0 → 다리 → 화면 비교&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3130.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out10" value="&lt;b&gt;check_design 답&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;check_result/3.0 — 통과 · errors[kind] · 레시피 · 조립 방법&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3197.0" width="210.0" height="71.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out11" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/hmi/save_build (서비스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;build/2 → 다리 → 웹&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3278.0" width="210.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.out12" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/gripper/command — 예정&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;gripper_open: 0.0865 m · 10 N (정지 잠금 때만, E-98)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2204.0" y="3331.0" width="210.0" height="57.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st0" value="① 명령: 설계 선택(get_design으로 design/3.0) · 출발 · 스캔 · [계속] · 취소. 4초(timeout.command_s) 안에 확정 못 하면 실행 안 함 → TIMEOUT" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2520.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st1" value="② 시작 점검(로봇 · 그리퍼 · 카메라 서비스 · 다리 연결 · 조립 자리) → 관측 자세 move_to(observe)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2570.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st2" value="③ 확인 부탁 check_progress(design_id · run_id · part_ids) → 답을 TaskPlanner에" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2620.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st3" value="④ 공급: 기본 = 공급 칸 6개(robot.yaml supply_mode slots) · 흩뿌림(scatter — 기본 전환은 박진용 PR 뒤): observe_supply → find_blocks → 고른 블록 → pick_place(나머지 블록은 장애물 obstacles, E-68) · 블록당 집기 2번까지(W178) · 맞는 블록 없으면 WAIT_SUPPLY(no_match_block · tilted_block) → [계속]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2670.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st4" value="⑤ 부품마다 pick_place 결과 → VERIFY(check_progress) → 다음 부품 → 끝나면 DONE. 그리퍼 응답 없음 · 피드백 없음 = ERROR(E-74)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2750.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st5" value="⑥ 스캔: robot.yaml scan.poses 5자세(observe · 뒤 왼쪽 · 앞 · 앞 오른쪽 · 옆, W186)마다 move_to → scan_capture → scan_infer → scan_result 방송 → SCAN_REVIEW(저장된 설계 select_design → READY · scan = 다시 · cancel → IDLE)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2800.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st6" value="⑦ 멈춤이면 STOPPED → 다시 시작 → 쥔 블록 확인 → 진행 확인부터(첫 move_to 0.5배). 웹 끊김 3초면 지금 부품까지 놓고 WAIT_HMI. 시간 제한(서비스 3 · move_to 45 · pick_place 90초)을 넘으면 safety/stop(source task) 먼저 · 잠금 중 [초기화] · [그리퍼 열기]는 예정(E-98)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2880.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st7" value="⑧ 관측 ↔ 레시피(part_id = &lt;설계 ID&gt;_&lt;역할&gt;_&lt;그룹 3자리&gt;_&lt;부품 2자리&gt;) → 진행표 progress/2.0(있음 · 없음 · 높이 · 오차) → 방송" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="2994.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st8" value="⑨ 다음 부품 = placements sequence의 첫 미배치(받침 있음) · 설계 좌표 + 조립 원점 → 로봇 좌표(motion_math)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3044.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st9" value="⑩ BlockPicker: 덮임 · 기울어짐 뺌 → 놓을 자세와 같고 틈 gap_mm ≥ 22.2 mm(E-49) → 겹침 없음 먼저 → 틈 넓은 것 · 윗면 높은 것. 맞는 자세가 없으면 임시 적재대(받침)에 세워 놓고 다시 잡기 1번(E-87 · E-91 · E-93) — main은 운영 꺼 둠 · 정식 흐름은 박진용 W188 PR(예정)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3094.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st10" value="⑪ 검사 1 ~ 20번: 형식 · 파고듦 · 받침 · 안정성(무게중심 여유 7 mm, 쌓는 도중) · 잡기 틈 · 막힌 칸 · 작업영역 · 블록 수 ≤ 54" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3208.0" width="520.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st11" value="⑫ 21번 Template 검사(base_recipe의 template.composition — 구성 형태 · 범위 · 관계) → 통과면 변환기 ①(parts → recipe/3.0 + placements/3.0) → 답. 요청 틀림 = REQUEST_INVALID · TEMPLATE_SHAPE · TEMPLATE_RANGE · errors[kind]" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3258.0" width="520.0" height="70.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.st12" value="⑬ run_id CSV(log_dir) · build/2 요약 → BuildSender가 save_build(다리 → 웹). 못 보내면 pending_builds/에 두고 다시 · 영구 거절(retry false)은 rejected/로" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b9c2cc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1638.0" y="3372.0" width="520.0" height="55.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c0" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.300;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in0" target="task.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1602.0" y="2531.5"/><mxPoint x="1602.0" y="2532.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c1" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.171;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in1" target="task.st6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1610.0" y="2612.5"/><mxPoint x="1610.0" y="2892.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c2" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#1f4fd6;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.000;entryY=0.300;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="task.in2" target="task.st0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1618.0" y="2693.5"/><mxPoint x="1618.0" y="2532.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="task.c3" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#e00000;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=5;exitX=1.000;exitY=0.500;exitDx=0;exitDy=