ss (서비스 받음)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;design_id · run_id · part_ids&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2684.0" y="2564.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wrist_block.in2" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/vision/find_blocks (서비스 받음)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;run_id — 공급 관측 자세에서&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2684.0" y="2632.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wrist_block.in3" value="&lt;b&gt;/d2/vision/scan_capture · scan_infer (서비스 받음)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;pose_id · run_id / 추론 요청&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2684.0" y="2700.0" width="210.0" height="58.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wrist_block.in4" value="&lt;b&gt;TF base_link → rg2_tcp · 손목 보정값&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;rg2_tcp 틀 hand-eye(W156) · 기울기 밀림 고침(E-83 · E-85)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f4f6f8;strokeColor=#9aa5b1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2684.0" y="2768.0" width="210.0" height="72.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wrist_block.in5" value="&lt;b&gt;get_design 답 (설계 캐시)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#0b5fa5&quot;&gt;design/3.0 — run_id 바뀔 때만 다시 읽음&lt;/sp